  {
   "id": "deserted-149203@1.2.9",
   "gameId": "deserted-149203",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2.9",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-29T04:30:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our mission always was to provide you with the best gameplay experience we can offer. Therefore we spent extra time refining and balancing the game .",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The fully updated version of Deserted is available right now on Steam for Windows and Linux.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "1. We added simple vibration effects to the controller. By default the vibrations are set to Enabled. You can disable vibration by going to Options -Controller – Vibration and set it to Disabled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. We localized the game for additional Dutch, Korean and Traditional Chinese languages. Plus Prologue localization in all supported 13 languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Further enhancing players abilities by adding Parry and Ricochet to the arsenal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. We refactored part of the code and further optimize the game to bring steady 60fps and further enhance the experience on Desktop-PC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fix Achievement progress where in some cases Achievements would not unlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fix to video playback. In a few cases video playback could prevent game progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fix to collision in parts that could prevent game progress and further refinements to occluding level geometry.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Refined and polished readability after boss battles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Additionally we added a Guide section in our game’s Main Menu where you can explore a host of necessary information and access all in-game tutorials.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. 3 Levels of Difficulty to experience the game at your pace.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "11. Added new music to boss fights! More bosses in the game will now feature additional music.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus many more fixes to improve gameplay and provide you with satisfying experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please help us by reviewing Deserted so we can better understand what you enjoyed and where we can improve our game design and development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Big THANKS to everyone who gave Deserted a chance!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
