  {
   "id": "deserted-149203@1.2.3",
   "gameId": "deserted-149203",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2.3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-22T01:42:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "DESERTED Patch 1.2.3 comes with hundreds of Bug and Level Stability fixes across the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Too many to go through but we took time to sweep through every level for places the player could get stuck on or clip through. We tried to fix and take care of any camera occluding geometry, and simplified areas for the ease of player traversal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also took care of many story progression bugs that presented themselves.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many localization fixes across all languages, and UI fixes to accommodate text formatting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bugs related to the vehicles, especially in coop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bugs related to climbing during coop and single player. Players will no longer get stuck at the tops of ledges. Instances of being able to clip beneath the ground should be eliminated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new music to boss fights! More bosses in the game will now feature additional music.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance optimizations across the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are committed to continuing to polish and fix any remaining issues and expand on the features in Deserted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the next few updates we are planning to add light character customization, expand our accessibility options including difficulty levels, a balance pass that will add a few extra enemies and resolve audio balance issues to make the player experience more enjoyable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
